# Brill: The Old Brewery (mod-brill-home, tools/town/brewery.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Brill Endures granted (the
# project's stage 1, <9:1>: the brewery's stages are invisibility kind 9), Brewmaster Oren Blackbarrel at the old
# brewhouse's door beside the Gallows' End. The Kegs Are Empty (the old copper, six piles of spoiled stores, six
# Brewhouse Rats, the ledger); A Proper Fermentation (the goblins' pump below the zeppelin tower, six rotten casks,
# Oliver Dwor's hoops, the vats and the casks); Taste of the Living (four bitterroot, Hamlin's culture, Saldean's
# grain, the three batches, three tasters, and the choice: the old family brown, the mark q971613); A Bitter Batch
# (the spoiled barrels, Bram and Calla questioned, the cellar hatch and the wall-rot, the vent); To Absent Friends
# (Renee and Marta invited, the market's sample barrels, the trestles, and the name: Lordaeron Reserve, the mark
# q971620). Each quest moves the stage on; then the brewery open (<9:6>, Oren behind its counter, the weekly offered)
# and the house's barrel stand and cabinet bought from him (<9:7>, the mark q971606).
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
cmd .brilltown grant 971000
# Stage 1: Oren at the brewhouse door.
go 0 2219.0 266.5 34.9
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has <9:1>
talk 971600
accept 971600 971600
# The Kegs Are Empty: the old copper (the hall seen past it) and the spoiled stores.
